FDk7oic-TTFNEY-ZH2l1HvI60rm3ydrTxapniGDY0ydwIhuis_MxHBM1wD6-rewi374Tx5MaACM=
xJE9baXsVsiKqpPiQSGxoF200CHzA-lAA6NGYGASvF-dCcXSXFaKY1Q/4vb/C_LIOM-JQPm1xtH=
WsMhaCQ/h30/h001.c3oeDXbvj820aUTZ2XnT1VOMs3PCG7Upy0taRo96PL8" style=3D"colo=
r: #0077B6;">security breach at Binance</a>.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">TRM Labs also calculated that the breach w=
as =E2=80=9Cthe largest crypto theft on record=E2=80=9D.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">News of Binance=E2=80=99s security breach =
sent bitcoin falling by more than 3% to a six-week low of $76,368 =E2=80=93=
 although it has since recovered back to $78,335 (-0.6%).</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">US stocks linked to cryptocurrencies fell =
in after-hours trading.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Shares in the crypto exchange Coinbase Glo=
bal are down 4.8%, while Strategy, the US company that <a href=3D"https://a=
blink.editorial.theguardian.com/ss/c/u001.Yw_JkLMEmFuifc_XG18IRyTNtZQ7fIEMg=
szcCSneHEA13-uHzzNLsl3ZqJFCJlFe3appgJ5W84gRw2oS0KbOu9FEb7ExqssLv-yNEPQvM7JS=
3rp8TpiwKvUHI3tSL3WkbqJZN4k1ZK4MjFBtcXOrjHEyRA7m6xmpA0H1SoglabY2JbtlKn885CM=
OIvwZR0qDzwYO43VC-eaBN0tb45Xqx6AlQw7JGLepmNz6rF_AObuDTgFh9G1sNF4iG8aiY4Fwpp=
QWMFMq75FniyQzB8duRkraf_rodrHnpjDwuC3l18w/4vb/C_LIOM-JQPm1xtHWsMhaCQ/h31/h0=
01.MRD6edRYVAC1C-7HWDaOgpDGenEmO9E9vUPewqVdneI" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">h=
as been a massive buyer of bitcoin</a>, fell 5.75%.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">Britain=E2=80=99s housing market is feelin=
g an autumnal chill as rising mortgage rates hit demand.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">UK annual house price growth slowed to 0.5=
% in October, the slowest pace since January 2024, data from Nationwide thi=
s morning shows. That is down from 0.8% in the year to September.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">On a monthly basis, the average price of a=
 house was unchanged this month.</p>
<p style=3D"margin: 0 0 16px 0;">The jump in fixed-rate mortgages to almost=
 6%, on average, appears to have dampened buyers=E2=80=99 enthusiasm, pushi=
ng up the cost of repaying a mortgage.</p>
